{"id":"8556c1ac7447fbfa","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-McGee.md","title":"FS的ω-不一致性定理","display":"thm-McGee — FS的ω-不一致性定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-McGee","aliases":["91-thm-McGee"],"display":"thm-McGee — FS的ω-不一致性定理","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-omega-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-McGee"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-McGee</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-McGee — FS的ω-不一致性定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ad5058535b9125d\" href=\"?note=8ad5058535b9125d\" title=\"91-df-omega-consistency\">91-df-omega-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-McGee-—-FS-的-$\\omega$-不一致性定理\">thm-McGee — FS 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致性定理</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> (含标准组合真理公理及 capture/release 规则的 Friedman–Sheard 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)\\)</span> (由 McGee 对角构造得到的一元公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS})\">\\(\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS})\\)</span> (FS 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}McGee}\\vdash\n\\exists\\theta(x)\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\theta(x)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\neg\\theta(\\overline n)\n\\right],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}McGee}\\vdash\n\\exists\\theta(x)\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\theta(x)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\neg\\theta(\\overline n)\n\\right],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从而</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>McGee 的构造利用自指与可迭代真理规则，把“存在某个有限真理迭代层”\n与每个具体有限层的否定组合成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致性见证。这里只记录定理\n所需的见证形式，不把它误写成 FS 证明自身一致性或所有高阶一致性。</p>\n<p>Gödel 第二不完备定理并未被“突破”：FS 可在句法上一致，却不能\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致。UTB 既没有 FS 的自指规则闭包，也仍对 PA 保守，所以\n不能按原备注声称 UTB 满足同一封闭性并证明各阶一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-McGee-—-FS-的-$\\omega$-不一致性定理","text":"thm-McGee — FS 的 $\\omega$-不一致性定理","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"8ad5058535b9125d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS})","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}McGee}\\vdash\n\\exists\\theta(x)\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\theta(x)\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\neg\\theta(\\overline n)\n\\right],","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1352,"backlinks":[{"id":"cda20fabbaa06580","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.m